a2=a9.$3$isSubsection("Lexicon","Picks which word source the puzzle draws its words from. Spoken, Written and Dictionary run from the commonest words to every word in the dictionary, each containing the one before; the Daily and Weekly use Written, and Expansion uses Dictionary.",!0)
